__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# Anchored to the repo root: the WORKING results/ directory (regenerated
# scratch output of a live run) is not tracked. Unanchored "results/" also
# matched every captured/*/results/ directory -- the actual reproducibility
# data reproduce_all.sh depends on -- so none of it was ever pushed, and a
# fresh clone of this repo could not reproduce anything despite the paper's
# own claims about that script. Found 2026-08-31, backfilled in the same
# commit that fixes this line.
/results/
# Was also a blanket "*.parquet", which caught the same captured/ files a
# second way even once /results/ was anchored. Removed rather than scoped:
# nothing in this repo needs an unpinned rule for a whole file type.
